<query_tools>
    <text source="Database">数据库</text>
    <text source="Indexes">索引</text>
    <text source="expression">表达式</text>
    <text source="Index usage statistics are unavailable. %1">索引使用统计不可用。%1</text>
    <text source="Performance Schema is disabled on this server.&#10;&#10;To enable it on MySQL or MariaDB:&#10;1. Open the server configuration file (my.cnf on Linux or my.ini on Windows).&#10;2. Add the following setting to the existing [mysqld] section:&#10;&#10;[mysqld]&#10;performance_schema = ON&#10;&#10;3. Restart the database service and check that the setting is ON:&#10;&#10;SHOW VARIABLES LIKE 'performance_schema';&#10;&#10;Let the server collect statistics during normal use, then run Analyze database again.">此服务器已禁用 Performance Schema。&#10;&#10;在 MySQL 或 MariaDB 上启用它：&#10;1. 打开服务器配置文件（Linux 上为 my.cnf，Windows 上为 my.ini）。&#10;2. 在现有的 [mysqld] 段中添加以下设置：&#10;&#10;[mysqld]&#10;performance_schema = ON&#10;&#10;3. 重启数据库服务并确认设置为 ON：&#10;&#10;SHOW VARIABLES LIKE 'performance_schema';&#10;&#10;让服务器在正常使用期间收集统计信息，然后重新分析数据库。</text>
    <text source="Performance Schema table I/O instrumentation is disabled.">Performance Schema 的表 I/O 监控已禁用。</text>
    <text source="No table reads have been observed for this database in the current counters.">当前计数器未记录此数据库的表读取。</text>
    <text source="Table">表格</text>
    <text source="Index">索引</text>
    <text source="Key parts">键列</text>
    <text source="Index reads">索引读取次数</text>
    <text source="Table reads">表读取次数</text>
    <text source="Reason">原因</text>
    <text source="Table was read, but this index recorded no reads.">该表有读取记录，但此索引没有读取记录。</text>
    <text source="Based on the current Performance Schema counters. Unique indexes and indexes starting with a visible foreign-key column are excluded. Counters can reset and may cover only part of the workload.">数据来自当前 Performance Schema 计数器。排除唯一索引及以可见外键列开头的索引。计数器可能重置，且可能只涵盖部分工作负载。</text>
    <text source="Finding">检测结果</text>
    <text source="Matching index">匹配索引</text>
    <text source="Matching key parts">匹配键列</text>
    <text source="Duplicate">重复索引</text>
    <text source="Left-prefix overlap">左前缀重叠</text>
    <text source="Compares visible BTREE indexes with named columns. Primary keys are excluded. Review constraints and usage before changing indexes.">比较具有命名列的可见 BTREE 索引，主键除外。更改索引前请检查约束和使用情况。</text>
    <text source="Filter by table or index name">按表名或索引名筛选</text>
    <text source="Index recommendations are unavailable for this query. Use a SELECT on one table with simple WHERE filters, an INNER JOIN of up to three tables, or a LEFT JOIN of two tables. Join conditions must use qualified columns.">此查询没有可用的索引建议。支持带简单 WHERE 筛选条件的单表 SELECT、最多三表的 INNER JOIN 或两表的 LEFT JOIN。连接条件中的列必须带表名或别名。</text>
    <text source="Current indexes">现有索引</text>
    <text source="Index suggestions">索引建议</text>
    <text source="Key columns are listed in index order. Recommendations consider visible BTREE indexes with named columns.">键列按索引顺序列出。建议仅考虑具有命名列的可见 BTREE 索引。</text>
    <text source="%1 (alias: %2)">%1（别名：%2）</text>
    <text source="primary key">主键</text>
    <text source="unique index">唯一索引</text>
    <text source="non-unique index">非唯一索引</text>
    <text source=" · excluded from matching"> · 不参与匹配</text>
    <text source="No indexes found in the table metadata.">表元数据中未找到索引。</text>
    <text source="Cannot suggest an index for this JOIN. Each pair of join columns must have matching supported types and collations.">无法为此 JOIN 推荐索引。每对连接列必须具有匹配的受支持类型和排序规则。</text>
    <text source="Suggestions consider a plan that starts with %1 and joins the other tables in SQL order. Check EXPLAIN for the actual join order.">建议假定先读取 %1，再按 SQL 中的顺序连接其他表。请通过 EXPLAIN 查看实际连接顺序。</text>
    <text source="ORDER BY is not evaluated by these suggestions.">这些建议不评估 ORDER BY。</text>
    <text source="Cannot suggest an index for %1. The column is unavailable or its type does not match a supported literal comparison.">无法为 %1 推荐索引。列不可用，或其类型不支持此类字面量比较。</text>
    <text source="No supported lookup or filter columns for this table.">此表没有受支持的查找列或筛选列。</text>
    <text source="No supported WHERE filter on the left table. The join condition can be used to look up matching rows on the right.">左表没有受支持的 WHERE 筛选条件。连接条件可用于在右表中查找匹配行。</text>
    <text source="The join supplies a lookup value for %1 when the other table is read first.">如果先读取另一张表，连接条件将提供 %1 的查找值。</text>
    <text source="When the other table is read first, a composite key can look up the combination (%1) together, narrowing the search to rows that match all join columns.">如果先读取另一张表，复合键可按组合 (%1) 查找，将范围缩小到所有连接列均匹配的行。</text>
    <text source="Check EXPLAIN for the actual join order.">请通过 EXPLAIN 查看实际连接顺序。</text>
    <text source="&#10;&#10;The unique key can find the row first. Remaining join conditions are checked on that row. Check EXPLAIN for the actual join order.">&#10;&#10;唯一键可先找到行，再检查其余连接条件。请通过 EXPLAIN 查看实际连接顺序。</text>
    <text source="Existing index: %1 on %2 (%3).&#10;&#10;%4">现有索引：%2 上的 %1（%3）。&#10;&#10;%4</text>
    <text source="Equality conditions match its full unique key, so the server can look up at most one row.">等值条件匹配整个唯一键，因此服务器最多找到一行。</text>
    <text source="Its leading columns match the equality conditions and a range condition, if present.">索引前导列匹配等值条件，以及存在的范围条件。</text>
    <text source="No candidate shown because the combined key exceeds the analyzer's 767-byte limit.">组合键超过分析器的 767 字节限制，未显示候选索引。</text>
    <text source="Leading equality columns can narrow the index search to matching values.">前导等值列可以将索引查找限制为匹配值。</text>
    <text source="The key can narrow the search using these filters: %1.">该键可利用这些筛选条件缩小查找范围：%1。</text>
    <text source="The next column, %1, can limit the scan to the requested range.">下一列 %1 可以将扫描限制在所需范围内。</text>
    <text source="Other range conditions still need to be checked after finding candidate rows.">找到候选行后，仍需检查其他范围条件。</text>
    <text source="Actual benefit depends on selectivity and workload. Compare EXPLAIN plans before adopting the index.">实际收益取决于选择性和工作负载。采用索引前请比较 EXPLAIN 计划。</text>
    <text source="Candidate BTREE index on %1 (%2)&#10;&#10;%3">候选 BTREE 索引：%1（%2）&#10;&#10;%3</text>
    <text source="&#10;&#10;Some join columns have unsupported types, lengths or collations and are excluded from this lookup.">&#10;&#10;部分连接列的类型、长度或排序规则不受支持，已从此次查找中排除。</text>
    <text source="&amp;Database">数据库(&amp;D)</text>
    <text source="Analyze database">分析数据库</text>
    <text source="Data Size">数据大小</text>
    <text source="Estimated space allocated for table data in the selected database.">所选数据库中表数据占用空间的估算值。</text>
    <text source="Index Size">索引大小</text>
    <text source="Estimated space allocated for indexes. For InnoDB, this is secondary index space.">索引分配空间的估算值。对于 InnoDB，此值仅指二级索引。</text>
    <text source="Index Share">索引占比</text>
    <text source="Index Size divided by Data Size plus Index Size.">索引大小除以数据和索引的总大小。</text>
    <text source="Candidates">候选项</text>
    <text source="Total candidates on the active tab, including rows hidden by a filter. For Query suggestions, counts proposed indexes for the SQL query.">当前选项卡中的候选项总数，包括被筛选隐藏的行。在查询建议中，此值为 SQL 查询的建议索引数。</text>
