    <text source="Cards show estimated rows per lookup. Arrows show estimated output rows when available.">卡片显示每次查找的估算行数。若有数据，箭头显示估算输出行数。</text>
    <text source="Sort">排序</text>
    <text source="Materialize">物化</text>
    <text source="The optimizer plans an explicit sort of the input rows.">优化器计划对输入行执行显式排序。</text>
    <text source="The optimizer plans to store the subquery result for use by the outer query.">优化器计划保存子查询结果，供外层查询使用。</text>
