    <text source="Uses values from the outer query. Its result depends on the current outer row.">使用外层查询的值。结果取决于外层查询的当前行。</text>
    <text source="Enclosing query block #%1">外层查询块 #%1</text>
    <text source="Sorting and filtering use the full result. Export saves all matching rows; copy uses the selection.">排序和筛选针对完整结果。导出保存所有匹配的行；复制仅使用选中内容。</text>
