    <text source="Results will appear automatically">结果将自动显示</text>
    <text source="After the first query, Profiler will show graphs and TOP. History will appear in %1 and %2.">执行首个查询后，Profiler 将显示图表和 TOP。历史记录将显示在“%1”和“%2”中。</text>
